<title>USA: Nickelodeon to launch children's channel in Turkey.</title>
<headline>Nickelodeon to launch children's channel in Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nickelodeon, a division of Viacom Inc, said Tuesday it had agreed to launch a 12-hour children's television channel in Turkey.</p>
<p>The company said it would work with Media Group, a partnership of Karacan, Raks Holding and Yelkenci, to produce, distribute and operate the channel.</p>
<p>No further details were disclosed.</p>
</text>
